{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04308","headline":"正夜侍宴应诏 · 薛曜","name":"正夜侍宴应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重关钟漏通，夕敞凤皇宫。\n双阙祥烟里，千门明月中。\n酒杯浮湛露，歌曲唱风流。\n侍臣咸醉止，恒慙恩遇崇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛曜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}